# Let git normalise source files to LF in the repository and convert on checkout.
* text=auto

# CSV fixtures reproduce a real Strong export byte for byte: CRLF line endings
# and NO trailing newline. The test suite asserts both. Git must never normalise
# them, or the fixture arrives LF-only on Linux/macOS and those tests fail on
# every platform except the one it was committed from.
*.csv -text

# Screenshots are binary. `text=auto` above already detects that, but this
# repository has been bitten by EOL normalisation before (see the CSV rule), and
# a mangled PNG fails silently rather than loudly.
*.png -text
